# Walkthrough - Vote Verification & Interactive Landing Page

I have implemented a complete end-to-end vote verification flow and enhanced the landing page to be more interactive and functional.

## Changes Made

### 1. Vote Verification System
- **Hash Generation**: When a user casts a ballot in [ElectionVotingInterface](file:///d:/E-Voting%20System/src/pages/ElectionVotingInterface.tsx#6-166), a unique 64-character SHA-256 equivalent hash is generated.
- **Data Persistence**: The hash and vote details (candidate, party, timestamp) are saved to `localStorage`.
- **Verification Page**: A new [VoteVerification](file:///d:/E-Voting%20System/src/pages/VoteVerification.tsx#5-165) page allows users to enter their hash to verify their vote on the "ledger".

### 2. Landing Page Interactivity
- Linked the feature cards to actual application routes:
  - **End-to-End Encryption** -> `/elections` (Voting Portal)
  - **Tamper-Proof Audit** -> `/verify` (Vote Verification)
  - **100% Accessibility** -> `/dashboard` (Voter Dashboard)

## Verification Results

### Vote Verification Flow
1. Navigate to the Voting Portal and cast a vote.
2. Observe the generated hash on the confirmation screen.
3. Click "Verify Receipt" to go to the verification page.
4. The hash is matched against the local "ledger" and the vote details are displayed.

### Landing Page Navigation
- Clicking each feature card correctly navigates to its intended destination, providing a seamless user experience.
